 risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &gt;= 1.81 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 40 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals with grey-zone financial position and high ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &gt;= 1.81 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals, grey-zone financial position, and severe ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &lt; 1.81 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 10 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals but financial distress risk, despite negligible ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &lt; 1.81 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 20 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals but financial distress risk, despite low ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &lt; 1.81 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 30 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals but financial distress risk and medium ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &lt; 1.81 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 40 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals but financial distress risk and high ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 7 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &lt; 1.81 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strong fundamentals are outweighed by financial distress and severe ESG risk.&quot;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_1184489452228608] &gt;= 4 AND [Calculation_1184489452228608] &lt;= 6 AND [Calculation_1184489466310660] &gt; 2.99 AND [Calculation_1297739223683075] &lt; 10 THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Moderate fundamentals, safe financial posi