          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Disclaimer:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> This dashboard is intended solely to showcase the workbook author&apos;s skills and practical use of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Tableau and Tableau Public</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>. It is created for demonstration and portfolio purposes only and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>is not intended for academic or professional research</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>. The visualizations and observations presented should </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>not be interpreted as legitimate or conclusive findings</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
