    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Metric Guide'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#0f172a' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='85250' id='3' type-v2='text' w='86700' x='6600' y='7375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Descriptive Analysis</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>The dashboard summarizes each company using financial, ESG, and sustainability indicators:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>1. Company Size:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>≤ 8,525 = Small</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>8,526–34,000 = Medium-Sized</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&gt; 34,000 = Big</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> — classifies organizational scale by employee count.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>2. Piotroski F-Score:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>0–3 = Weak</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>4–6 = Moderate</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>7–9 = Strong</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> — measures financial strength.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Altman Z-Score:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&gt; 2.99 = Safe</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>1.81–2.99 = Grey Zone</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&lt; 1.81 = Distress</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> — indicates financial distress risk.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>3. ESG Score:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&lt; 10 = Negligible</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>10–&lt;20 = Low</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>20–&lt;30 = Medium</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>30–&lt;40 = High</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>≥40 = Severe Risk</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> — measures ESG risk. The scoring framework appears consistent with a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Sustainalytics-style ESG Risk Rating</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, though the dataset does not definitively identify the provider.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>4. SDG Alignment:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Aligned + Strongly Aligned SDGs ÷ 17 × 100</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'> — measures alignment across all 17 UN SDGs. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>≤30% = Low</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&gt;30–60% = Moderate</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>&gt;60% = High Alignment</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Together, these metrics provide a concise profile of each company&apos;s </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>scale, financial condition, ESG risk, and SDG alignment</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>For the whole data transformation process and context of the project please refer to my GitHub Profile:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://github.com/ches-07&amp;quot;'>https://github.com/ches-07</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10' italic='true'>This is just a part of an unfinished portfolio project.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
